<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Dear Lord Jesus, with our tongues—</l><l>We gladly confess Thy name,</l><l>To the glory of the Father God above.</l><l>For to us to speak Thy praise,</l><l>Is the enjoyment of our days;</l><l>Calling JESUS is to call the One we love!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
